Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:42.48,Sign_Basic,Document Screen Sign,0,0,0,,{\an6\c&H524F4C&\bord0\shad0\b1\fay.13\frx4\fry0\fs16\move(926,390,596,320)}Shinozaki Takuma
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:44.47,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.93,0:00:46.40,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Very good, Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.73,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:50.96,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Is your meeting over already?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:54.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yep. It didn't take as long as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:58.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,And it looks like you finished \Neverything I asked you to do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Excellent work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:02.28,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Aw, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:06.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It was just regular work. \NNothing worth that kind of praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:10.54,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong \Nwith praising regular work?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:13.22,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I actually appreciate it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:14.22,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:23.31,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You know, I really am proud \Nof you, Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:29.48,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There's a Senpai where I work... \Nwho is tiny, and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.95,0:01:47.71,Show_Title,Title sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H292A2F&\bord0}My {\1a&HFF&\bord1\3c&HA183CA&}T{\3c&H000000&}iny {\bord0\1a&H00&}Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.95,Episode_Title,Sign,0,0,0,,#01 My Senpai Is {\c&H9E88E7&}Small {\c&H121310&}and Cute
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.95,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(527,296)\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HEAECE7&\blur2}m 0 0 l 180 0 l 180 90 l 0 90
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.95,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(527,296)\an5\fs16\c&H0D0D0D&\bord0\shad0\b1}Development Group 2\NPlanning, Team A\N{\fs24}Shinozaki Takuma\N{\fs16}(1st Year of Employment)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:17.93,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:22.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sh-Shinozaki-san! Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:23.72,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:28.33,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's just, well... \NI saw a cat go into those bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:31.35,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(527,296)\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HF8F8F7&\blur2}m 0 0 l 180 0 l 180 90 l 0 90
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.22,0:03:31.35,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(527,296)\an5\fs16\c&H0D0D0D&\bord0\shad0\b1}Development Group 2\NPlanning, Team A\N{\fs24}Katase Shiori\N{\fs16}(3rd Year of Employment)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:31.35,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,I thought it might \Ncome back out if I called to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:33.56,Main,Senpai,0,0,0,,That's what you were doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:36.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It was the cutest thing you ever saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:39.19,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,A tiny brown kitty, about this big...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:43.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Really fluffy and soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:46.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I already know you are, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:48.58,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I was talking about the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:51.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right! Of course! The cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.79,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's get moving, Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.14,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:11.68,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(117,296)\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HF7FBF6&\blur2}m 0 0 l 180 0 l 180 90 l 0 90
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.18,0:04:11.68,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(117,296)\an5\fs16\c&H0D0D0D&\bord0\shad0\b1}Development Group 2\NTeam A Manager\N{\fs24}Akina Chihiro\N{\fs16}(5th year of Employment)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:10.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I sent the plan for our entry \Ninto the project competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:16.31,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,so please check it, when you get a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:20.44,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Wait, already? There's still \Na while until the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:24.09,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I know! But since we'll need to \Nincorporate input from the client,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:27.10,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,the sooner we get it checked, \Nthe sooner I can make those adjustments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:31.63,Main,Katase,0,0,0,,Makes sense. Well done, Katase-san. \NI appreciate how timely you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.40,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Nice one, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.84,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,This is all normal stuff. \NI'm a grown-up, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:44.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I have to say, desk work really does \Na number on the back and shoulders...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:46.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,My whole body feels creaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:50.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's even worse when you're \Non the computer all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:51.72,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Definitely...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.72,0:04:55.35,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,My shoulders can really seize up on me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:58.87,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I think there might be more to it \Nthan just work, in that regard...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:01.86,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's the kind of thing that \Nmakes you want a massage, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:04.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, what a great idea! I'd love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:10.22,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wait... did I just stumble into a mildly \Nerotic situation involving a massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Want me to rub them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.15,0:05:14.50,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:23.21,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Right there... It feels... so good...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:30.22,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,If you keep that up... I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:35.38,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,N-No, nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:40.65,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I get stiff shoulders, too, so I was thinking \Nabout maybe getting a massage myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:46.16,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sounds like a case where a hardworking \Nkohai needs some senpai encouragement!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:50.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, I couldn't ask you to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:51.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.54,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just don't fall asleep \Nfrom being too comfy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:03.84,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Squeezey, squeezey, squeezey, squeezey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.52,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai's tiny hands are all over my shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.99,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm getting squeezed! \NShe's kneading me like dough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:11.43,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's like I'm in the world's \Ncomfiest theme park!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:18.75,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san, you're so... hard, and big...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:23.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I don't know if my hands \Ncan make you feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:28.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, uh, I think that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Did it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.27,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yes! Maybe a little too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:36.83,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Er, forget I said anything! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:44.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,"And that is my proposal."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:47.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, hopefully that should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:49.59,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe I should run through it again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:53.40,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,"I'm Shinozaki Takuma \Nwith Dev Group 2's Team A."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:56.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,"My proposal involves the upcoming anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:59.96,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,of our company's main mascot \Ncharacter, Meowtaro, which—"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:00.17,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's that you've got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:02.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:04.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Did I scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:09.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The new employee project \Npresentations are tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:10.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,so I was practicing during my free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That takes me back! \NI remember what it was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:18.67,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,And so, by arranging a collaboration \Nbetween popular sweets brands
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:20.99,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,and our company's mascot character, Meowtaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:24.71,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,I believe we could cultivate customers \Nin a new demographic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:30.63,sign_10663_99_Meowtaro_Collabo,Powerpoint,0,0,0,,{\pos(193.333,154.667)}Meowtaro Collabo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:30.63,Sign_Basic,Powerpoint,0,0,0,,{\frz180\fs10\b1\c&H696C6B&\bord0\shad0\an1\pos(296,104)}Currently popular sweets
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:30.30,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Er, uh, pardon me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:34.01,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I made some goofs \Nwith the materials for my proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:38.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But as you can see, I'm still here, \Nso relax and give your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:39.98,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What a random bit of encouragement!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.71,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:48.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I just have this tendency to get \Nsuper nervous when it's showtime...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:52.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,They say writing the kanji for "person" in your \Nhand and pretending to swallow it helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.49,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:55.85,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's probably just a superstition...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:58.27,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Although one theory says the palm \Nhas certain pressure points,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:02.56,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,and by tracing the kanji for "person" \Nyou can press them for a relaxation effect—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:02.38,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.09,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Something to relax you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:10.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Specially made by your Senpai, \Nit's the kanji for "person."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.09,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:16.60,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-So close! Senpai's tiny hand \Nis right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:20.18,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-It almost seems like a waste to eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:24.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I can always make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,So, by all means, eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.76,0:08:29.11,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She is so wifely, it's killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:33.11,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-Then, in that case, don't mind if I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:43.53,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, er, did my breath tickle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:45.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's f-fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.25,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,H-How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:50.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Better! I think I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.76,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.79,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll be looking forward to another \Ntomorrow, before my presentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:59.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Not a problem! I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:04.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yamagishi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:07.27,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HFCFBFD&\blur2\pos(518,282)}m 0 0 l 180 0 l 180 90 l 0 90
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.77,0:09:07.27,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs16\c&H0D0D0D&\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(518,282)}Development Group 2\NTeam B, Designer\N{\fs24}Yamagishi Aiko\N{\fs16}(1st Year of Employment)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.01,Main - Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Will you be coming to the \Nend-of-month drinking party?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:07.27,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Oh, you bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's plus one, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.21,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,You're organizing, Shinozaki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:13.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I drew the short stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:17.22,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Hayakawa, you coming to \Nthe end of month drinking party?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.16,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\an5\bord0\shad0\c&HF0F8F7&\blur2\pos(116,284)}m 0 0 l 180 0 l 180 90 l 0 90
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.16,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an5\fs16\c&H0D0D0D&\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(116,284)}Development Group 2\NTeam A, Designer\N{\fs24\fscx96}Hayakawa Chinatsu\N{\fs16\fscx}(1st Year of Employment)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:20.78,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:23.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Again? Sociable as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:26.62,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Quit whining. I attended once, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.76,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, once. The first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.60,0:09:29.66,Italics - Top,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:30.38,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Once is plenty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:33.30,Italics - Top,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Staaare...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.55,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,Are you two going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.81,0:09:38.68,Main,Shinozaki/Hayakawa,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:42.06,Main,Yamagishi,0,0,0,,It's just, Shinozaki-kun seems \Nweirdly frank with you, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:46.04,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-That's not it! Hayakawa...san \Nhere is just a childhood friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:49.32,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly! We just grew up near each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.78,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Dating her? Is that really how it looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:56.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:59.40,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you and Hayakawa-san get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:00.70,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You, too, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:03.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's less that and more...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:05.90,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We were neighbors,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:09.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,and we attended preschool, \Nelementary, and middle school together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:13.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Then we just happened to end up \Nworking at the same company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:15.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's kinda like we're cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:20.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You seemed to be pretty friendly, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:23.50,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wait, what? Is she jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:25.85,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No, come on, Senpai would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:30.52,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's really nothing special. \NSure, we chat casually...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:32.27,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:40.48,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-S-Senpai?! She just said she was jealous! \NI did hear that, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:43.62,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And she does seem to be kind of sulky...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:47.53,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai's... jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.99,0:10:51.67,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That'd mean she... about me... for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:55.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:57.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:05.68,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:13.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I want to be friends with Hayakawa-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:20.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I've always thought she seems rather neat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:23.20,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,but we've never really had \Na chance to connect outside of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:25.77,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind, \Ncould you maybe introduce me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:26.94,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's what she meant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:29.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:33.21,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Just regretting my arrogance, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.51,Main,Server,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:39.12,Main,Server,0,0,0,,A party of three? I'll show you to your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:50.25,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Y'know, I tend to attract cats for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.50,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:55.64,Main,Shiori/Eyecatch Sign,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Senpai{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:02.16,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,This cardboard box is actually pretty heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:03.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Let me get that for you, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.30,Main,BG Coworker (Female),0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:09.66,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No, no, don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:11.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,These kinds of things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.17,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just let me know if you need any more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:15.66,Main,BG Coworker (Female),0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:17.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:19.76,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,There was a bit of a mix up with some data...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But it should be fine, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:32.48,Sign_Basic,BG Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(332,36)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\c&H92D5E5&\bord0\b1\4c&H456070&\shad2}40th Anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:36.71,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You never seem to get mad at people, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:39.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I mean, just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:44.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,If someone's already upset \Nabout their mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:46.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm not going to make it worse for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:50.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Besides, you can scold someone \Nwithout getting mad at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:54.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,More importantly, Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:54.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:57.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You haven't been reporting in enough, lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:12:59.96,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I haven't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:03.09,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Did I... screw up with work somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.22,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:07.22,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Am I getting scolded, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:10.60,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, well... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:15.35,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,When you work hard, \NI expect you to tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:19.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,J-Just when I work hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:25.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I don't want to miss your efforts, \Nespecially when you put your heart into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:30.78,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If this is supposed to be discipline, \Nthen sign me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:34.41,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's a senpai's duty...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.63,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,to praise a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:49.34,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, next time I work hard on something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.85,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'll try to make sure and notice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:13:55.22,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:02.11,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come on, we're back \Nto the office and back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:05.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right! Wait up, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:16.17,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's getting late, \Nbut I wanna keep going a bit longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:18.87,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Let's finish this up, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:28.41,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I bought two by mistake. \NYou're welcome to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:30.51,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:32.71,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, I should pay you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:35.39,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No, it's fine, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:38.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm forcing something off onto my subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:41.63,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Think of it as an abuse of authority!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:44.02,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Best abuse of authority ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:47.02,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you still not finished for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:51.53,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Well, I was just trying to \Nget to a good place to stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.40,0:14:54.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'll help you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:58.04,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But, I couldn't ask you to \Ntrouble yourself, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:01.47,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's a senpai's duty to help a kohai in need!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:02.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:05.82,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,once we're done, I'm going to abuse \Nmy authority and treat you to dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:08.80,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,They made a sequel to \Nthe best abuse of authority ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:12.17,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-then I'd appreciate the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:13.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:18.17,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That was faster than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:21.31,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Only because of you. Thanks again, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:23.81,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll pay for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:26.32,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No, not happening. I'm paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:27.56,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It'll be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:29.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:29.82,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:34.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's still a bit cold at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.73,0:15:37.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come on, let's hurry to the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:41.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sh-Shinozaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.53,0:15:42.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Please, just wear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:44.54,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:46.32,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Put your arms through the sleeves, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:48.27,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But I... I'll be fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:49.34,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:53.34,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Y'know, you don't need to have \Nauthority to abuse your power...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:59.60,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:06.79,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,There should be plenty of places open still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:08.46,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:12.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Um, aren't you cold, Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:14.49,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Nope. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:21.02,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,This jacket he lent me is really warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:25.38,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess because he was \Njust wearing it, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:29.31,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,Something about the size and the warmth...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.31,0:16:32.52,Italics,Shiori,0,0,0,,makes it feel like he's hugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:35.89,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wh-What in the world am I thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:38.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,U-um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:44.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I-I don't know... \Nif I can continue wearing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:45.94,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:47.80,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You can have it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:48.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:51.19,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,W-we're almost at the restaurant, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:53.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:57.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,we're close to the office... \NWhat if someone saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:16:59.18,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:03.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I should have considered that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:06.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No, no, I appreciate you letting me wear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:09.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come on, let's head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:11.46,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm feeling hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:14.47,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:17.47,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(260,96,288,96)\fnTimes New Roman\c&H95C8C5&\3c&HF7FEFE&\shad0\fay.3\frx4\fry22}Odo Eatery
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:17.47,Main,Server,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:20.60,Main,Server,0,0,0,,Party of two? I'll show you to your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.60,Main,Server,0,0,0,,The jacket smells like Senpai, \Nand that's a great smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.61,0:17:32.17,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Since it's nice and warm in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:34.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I think I'll take this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What should I order...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:43.92,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,There're so many options, \NI don't know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.30,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You can take your time to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Have you made up your mind, Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:51.63,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I think I have, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:53.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Then, I better decide, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:55.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You can take your time, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:01.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:05.14,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz24.78\fs18\frx342\fry24\c&H302B2E\bord0\shad0\pos(364.667,235.333)}Press button for service
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:05.14,Main,Server,0,0,0,,I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.97,0:18:10.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'll take the miso-glazed beef tongue \Nand mixed vegetable stew dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:13.63,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,And a fluffy soy milk pudding for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:16.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll have the saikyo-yaki \Ncooked mackerel dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:17.24,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That'll be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:19.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What about dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.72,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Pudding is really good, y'know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.72,0:18:26.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm a big fan, it's so soft, and sweet, \Nand just plain makes you happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.37,Main - Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll take one, too, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:28.92,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Pudding, pudding, more pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:28.92,Main,Server,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.81,Main,Server,0,0,0,,It'll be just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:34.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, I wanna thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:36.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,And not just for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.99,0:18:38.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:46.00,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I managed to make it through my project \Nproposal without clamming up, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:47.39,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:51.16,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It went well because \Nyou worked hard, Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:53.90,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I just helped out a tiny bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:58.65,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm obviously going to help \Na kohai who could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:01.41,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Because I'm your senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:05.50,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,W-Well, I appreciate all that help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:06.79,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:07.66,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:11.69,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Don't try and push yourself \Nto work overtime like today, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.69,0:19:16.17,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Working hard is good, \Nbut overwork is not. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:18.91,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:20.93,Main,Server,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:25.93,Main,Server,0,0,0,,Saikyo-yaki cooked mackerel, \Nand a miso-glazed beef tongue stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:27.67,Main,Server,0,0,0,,Please, enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come on, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:33.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,We'll have a nutritious meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:36.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,and then give it our best at work tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:37.69,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:42.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:43.93,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:45.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:47.32,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sensitive to hot food like a cat, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:48.09,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "too"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.09,0:19:50.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:05.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Good morning, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:09.64,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shinozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:11.35,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Calling out to another cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:14.23,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:17.73,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I heard it meowing a second ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:27.80,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?! It answered me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:28.83,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:35.32,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That was deeper than before, though. \NMaybe there's a second cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:44.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You! You! I can't believe you made fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:47.47,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Sorry! I didn't think \Nyou'd react like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:51.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,As punishment, for today, \Nyou have to be kitty Shinozaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:53.90,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Kitty Shinozaki...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:55.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I expect you to meow in response!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:56.56,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,M... Meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:58.30,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Y'know, this might be too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:00.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's kind of embarrassing—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.82,0:21:02.76,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,These are orders from your senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:03.52,Main - Top,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:06.38,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you understand?! You respond with "meow!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:06.64,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Good morning, Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:09.26,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:08.12,Main - Top,Shiori,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.36,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You look happy. Something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:15.56,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Just glad that my team is getting long!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:16.29,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,They are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:18.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,All right, Meowzaki, we're going to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:20.63,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Right, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:23.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You're supposed to say "Meow!" Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:24.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,M-Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.21,0:21:32.22,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's give it our best today, Meowzaki!
